@page "/{*path:nonfile}"

@*
    Never rendered — Root.razor has no router for it to land in. It exists so endpoint
    routing has a routable component for every non-file URL, which is what makes the
    server answer /logs, /host-changer and friends with the Root shell; the legacy
    App's own Router inside the interactive island then resolves the actual page.
*@

@code {
    [Parameter] public string? Path { get; set; }
}
